  "title": "Taco in a Bag",
  "description": "Taco in a bag, or walking tacos, are easy to put together and fun to eat! Enjoy your favorite taco fillings loaded into a corn chip bag and eaten with a fork.",
  "authors": [
    "Jennifer Madigan"
  ],
